        "original_id": "7d84455f-06ae-58d7-b789-61e1c79e1a28",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimi Mistry, Guy Ritchie, Om Puri, Linda Bassett, Gerard Butler, Tom Wilkinson, Thandie Newton, Mark Strong, Idris Elba, Tom Hardy, Toby Kebbell\n- Films: East Is East, RocknRolla, Blood Diamond, The Guru, Exam, West Is West, Ella Enchanted, The Truth About Love\n- TV Series: EastEnders, Coronation Street\n- Places: Salford, Lancashire\n- Concepts: mixed-ethnicity British household\n\nFacts:\n- Jimi Mistry was born on 1 January 1973 and is an English actor.\n- East Is East is set in Salford, Lancashire, in 1971 in a mixed-ethnicity British household headed by Pakistani father George, played by Om Puri, and English mother Ella, played by Linda Bassett.\n- East Is East is a 1999 film.\n- RocknRolla is a 2008 British-American crime comedy film written and directed by Guy Ritchie.\n- RocknRolla stars Gerard Butler, Tom Wilkinson, Thandie Newton, Mark Strong, Idris Elba, Tom Hardy, Jimi Mistry, and Toby Kebbell.\n- Jimi Mistry is best known for roles in EastEnders and Coronation Street and for appearing in films including East Is East, Blood Diamond, The Guru, Exam, West Is West, Ella Enchanted, and The Truth About Love.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
